Create a directory where the name of the directory is the VM template name. 

In the VM template directory create two files: <vm_template_name>.cfg.template and <vm_template_name>.xml.template (where <vm_template_name> is the name of the VM template that matched the containing directory).

The <vm_template_name>.cfg.template file can be created from the example file in the config/templates/ directory named vm_name.cfg.template.

The <vm_template_name>.xml.template is a templatized version of the Libvirt VM XML definition.
